 ProcessToolWithTable;globalParms;list;n1;parms
⍝ Presents a list of any length and allows processing selected rows; defaults only
 globalParms←##.APLGUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults
 globalParms.regKey←'MyApp'
 globalParms.caption←'My App'
 globalParms.icon←#.⎕NEW'Icon'(⊂'File'(GetFile'Misc\Sample.ico'))
 list←∪300⍴⎕NL-3
 list←list[⍋⊃list]
 list←list,,[0.5]↓##.APLGUI.APLTreeUtils2.FormatDateTime⊃{⍵[;1]}⎕AT list
 parms←##.APLGUI.ProcessTool.CreateParms
 parms.colTitles←'Name' 'Timestamp'
 parms.data←list
 n1←globalParms parms ##.APLGUI.ProcessTool.Create list((⍕⎕THIS),'.∆OnTestHandler_ProcessTool')
 ##.APLGUI.ProcessTool.ModalWait n1
